# CSPの許可先は実測で確定した最小構成。増やすときは埋め込みページでCSP違反を再確認する（README「セキュリティヘッダ」）。

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://open.spotify.com https://embed.music.apple.com; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/feed.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/sitemap.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
